  "introduction": "Ground survey and FTTH design for the Infinity Area estate along the Eastern Bypass.",
  "findings": "Existing wooden poles along the main access road are in good condition. An existing splice enclosure (POP) is located at the estate entrance.",
  "proposed_solution": "A 48-core main cable from the POP along the access road with a first-stage 1x8 splitter enclosure, and 12-core spur cables to FATs with 1x8 second-stage splitters.",
  "special_requirements": "One road crossing near P004 requires crossing protection.",
  "recommendations": "Proceed with construction after wayleave approval for the road crossing.",
